OL,3,GNEWSAPlay area shut for longer after
OL,4,Alatest vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's play area in one of
OL,7,FLiverpool's busiest parks will remain
OL,8,Fclosed for longer after being
OL,9,Fvandalised again.
OL,11,FThe play area in Sefton Park has been
OL,12,Fclosed since June after vandals ripped
OL,13,Fup sections of the floor surface
OL,14,Fmaterial.
OL,16,FLiverpool Council said repairs had been
OL,17,Fscheduled for 10 July, but the extreme
OL,18,Fheat meant they had not been possible.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
